@startuml
title TITLE

actor       "User"        as User
participant "Device"      as Device
participant "Peripheral"  as Peripheral

User -> Device : request
activate Device

Device -> Peripheral : command
activate Peripheral
Peripheral --> Device : response
deactivate Peripheral

alt success
  Device --> User : result
else failure
  Device --> User : error
end
deactivate Device

note over Device, Peripheral
  A note spanning both, for the detail
  that does not fit on an arrow.
end note

@enduml
